# Microsoft Solitaire Collection - Pi-hole v6 regex list
# Verified 2026-10-26 against app v4.27.9181.0 on Windows 11 (26100).
#
# HOW TO APPLY ON PI-HOLE v6 (there is no URL import for regex lists):
#   Settings > Domains > Add domain > kind = RegEx, type = Deny, paste one pattern per entry.
#   Or: pihole-FTL --config ... / direct DB import via pihole-updatelists (third-party).
#   Adding this file as a normal blocklist URL WILL NOT WORK - gravity parses each
#   line as a domain, rejects it, and silently blocks nothing.
#   Regex entries take effect immediately; no 'pihole -g' needed.
#
# FTL uses POSIX extended regex. Domains are matched lowercase and unanchored,
# so every pattern here anchors itself with (\.|^) ... $

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# A. Confirmed live in this app - highest value, safe to block
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# ad wrapper rendered inside WebView2; fetches the MSX/Xandr creative
(\.|^)domainreferrer[0-9]*\.microsoftcasualgames\.com$

# Xandr / AppNexus - MSX ServiceHost is ib.adnxs.com, plus regional shards
(\.|^)adnxs\.com$
(\.|^)adnxs\.net$
(\.|^)adnxs-simple\.com$

# Microsoft Advertising on MSN (ads.msn.com, mobileads.msn.com, pt.ads.msn.com ...)
(\.|^)ads\.msn\.com$
(\.|^)mobileads\.msn\.com$

# Vungle (Liftoff) - ad SDK bundled in the app, no non-ad use
(\.|^)vungle\.com$
(\.|^)tls\.vungle\.edgesuite\.net$

# InMobi / AerServ - SDK config is active in this app
(\.|^)mcg-ads\.inmobi\.com$
(\.|^)[a-z0-9-]+\.inmobicdn\.net$
(\.|^)aerserv-ads\.trafficmanager\.net$
(\.|^)ads-inmobi-comtm\.trafficmanager\.net$
(\.|^)d3tplke66d0j4g\.cloudfront\.net$

# Microsoft Casual Games ad plumbing
(\.|^)adbroker\.mp\.dse\.microsoft\.com$
(\.|^)mcg-msmonplat\.trafficmanager\.net$
(\.|^)msmonplat\.trafficmanager\.net$

# MSN video ads and Microsoft UET tracking
(\.|^)partner\.video\.syndication\.msn\.com$
(\.|^)bat\.bing\.com$

